[{"id": 8701, "uuid": "2b1e174b-d30f-4871-859a-463a25aaff37", "hitokoto": "我与旧事归于尽，来年依旧迎花开。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "保底全歪真君", "creator_uid": 11456, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1644385393", "length": 16}, {"id": 8713, "uuid": "b7adc2e1-72d5-41fe-9c35-06417073f8de", "hitokoto": "前世若不相欠，今生怎会相见。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1646358716", "length": 14}, {"id": 8714, "uuid": "567e5a2f-7e41-4d9c-ab29-b2ab4480dc84", "hitokoto": "一生一世一双人，半醉半醒半浮生，一花一世界，一叶一如来，一砂一极乐。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1646404910", "length": 34}, {"id": 8719, "uuid": "7e459212-9625-419e-878c-b5d56799ed2c", "hitokoto": "你的一生，我只借一程，这一程便是余生。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1646714693", "length": 19}, {"id": 8721, "uuid": "64b51e7b-b5a8-4596-aa59-830fb4ca963e", "hitokoto": "愿万般熙攘化为清风明月，四方梦想变成未来可期。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "柚fufu", "creator_uid": 11686, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1646894283", "length": 23}, {"id": 8722, "uuid": "a76b45a5-680f-46a7-a67c-3625a4da5a21", "hitokoto": "自古人生最忌满，半贫半富半自安，半命半天半机遇，半取半舍半行善；人生一半在于我，另外一半听自然。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "柚fufu", "creator_uid": 11686, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1646895256", "length": 48}, {"id": 8725, "uuid": "f4b75c75-e329-424c-90ed-3512b1d9568f", "hitokoto": "保持热爱，奔赴山海。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "Baymax1470", "creator_uid": 11722, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1647139694", "length": 10}, {"id": 8753, "uuid": "adaf28af-b7af-4fca-8b20-d1da77610703", "hitokoto": "拼命奔跑，华丽跌倒。人山人海，边走边爱。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1651913176", "length": 20}, {"id": 8754, "uuid": "db9d96f8-8991-4ca7-bfc5-13478ce7d761", "hitokoto": "如果本来就知道是结果失败的，那为何还要尝试呢？", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "8419", "creator_uid": 11434, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1652191313", "length": 23}, {"id": 8755, "uuid": "029c7020-b43b-40c7-8694-6954ae29bf4f", "hitokoto": "少年没有乌托邦，心向远方自明朗，与风随行皆理想，遗憾最终皆幻想！", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1651586957", "length": 32}, {"id": 8759, "uuid": "ae1eebf1-9352-439c-9a0b-15a98fc1bc61", "hitokoto": "天空偷喝了红酒，醉了臆想，红了脸颊，成了晚霞。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1652867671", "length": 23}, {"id": 8768, "uuid": "cdcbdd7e-9680-4f7c-9307-f7f487c2c070", "hitokoto": "我只对我喜欢的人说真话，我不喜欢你。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "王余凡", "creator_uid": 12177, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1651029492", "length": 18}, {"id": 8775, "uuid": "5b20c4ff-48ad-4331-b442-594c37558f63", "hitokoto": "或许相遇不再避开才是真的释怀了。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650109846", "length": 16}, {"id": 8776, "uuid": "b7969911-cb7b-4c60-bb8b-9fce191dbdc8", "hitokoto": "岁月总让人成长，却从不指明方向。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650109922", "length": 16}, {"id": 8777, "uuid": "d135594b-f537-4684-ab64-048b4b710cdc", "hitokoto": "我最怀念的是大家起哄我们两个的时候", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650111593", "length": 17}, {"id": 8781, "uuid": "22ea6cd7-cdbc-48a5-b3c3-628f58fef4c5", "hitokoto": "我在你看不见的地方，看了你无数次.", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650123684", "length": 17}, {"id": 8786, "uuid": "fce9d7a5-8f06-4071-9b5e-cb993eaf92ea", "hitokoto": "友情也好爱情也罢，如果累了，我们就回到第一天见面的时候吧", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650518221", "length": 28}, {"id": 8788, "uuid": "31700476-ea74-4a2e-8426-ff2d80948ef0", "hitokoto": "The best dream in the world.", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "xxsczs", "creator_uid": 11909, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1650638440", "length": 28}, {"id": 8789, "uuid": "2c2a30e6-0a14-48d9-b647-3e35037f0366", "hitokoto": "曾经是意中人，现在是忆中人。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650639801", "length": 14}, {"id": 8791, "uuid": "a6db1ead-7b05-493a-83f4-4fcabaae9955", "hitokoto": "暗恋是一个人的独舞，尽管我不会跳舞, 但我已经尝到孤独的滋味。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1650688824", "length": 31}, {"id": 8793, "uuid": "971cbd1e-ccb8-4dbf-b174-4b1ceb78f21f", "hitokoto": "树是生活，埋的是我，看花就好，别看我落魄。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "MEliauk", "creator": "王余凡", "creator_uid": 12177, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1651029326", "length": 21}, {"id": 8796, "uuid": "8d1c41f8-6ebd-4c53-91b6-088884256d03", "hitokoto": "妙语连珠是猎物，支支吾吾才是喜欢。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1649925452", "length": 17}, {"id": 8799, "uuid": "3460a674-e1b4-4ef6-823e-4337ee923d99", "hitokoto": "暗恋不会窥见天光，青梅抵不过天降，永远没有旧情复燃破镜重圆。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649919723", "length": 30}, {"id": 8800, "uuid": "442ea2af-4fcf-4211-95e3-33f303b0919e", "hitokoto": "BE是bad ending，BE其实也是best ending。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649918708", "length": 32}, {"id": 8801, "uuid": "e8acb55d-1d32-48c0-ab11-4b9ae6364a99", "hitokoto": "已逝者怀抱着爱撒手人间，未亡人背负着爱向死而生。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649919461", "length": 24}, {"id": 8802, "uuid": "929f109f-caef-48fb-822c-a8a51d5537f9", "hitokoto": "浪荡子死于忠贞，阴谋家死于忠诚，偷窃者死于奉献，自私者死于牺牲，向阳花死于黎明之前，野草死于无人问津的风，BE美学有着最残忍也最热烈的爱。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649918670", "length": 69}, {"id": 8804, "uuid": "97835d10-60da-4465-839b-2b682799e148", "hitokoto": "在太上忘情却终究人非草木。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649918421", "length": 13}, {"id": 8806, "uuid": "6c16ad82-57c5-40e1-8496-ae23836fe473", "hitokoto": "美在盛世烟火，人间喧嚣，他们终成遗憾。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649918389", "length": 19}, {"id": 8807, "uuid": "e72c132c-3cdf-48ad-b73d-3ba9a5c57930", "hitokoto": "你把一切都解构了，才会发现很多被歌颂的事情都是莫名其妙，很多事情存在的唯一意义就是被歌颂。", "type": "f", "from": "百度贴吧", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "YINGMJ", "creator_uid": 8456, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649524142", "length": 45}, {"id": 8808, "uuid": "3eebd91f-85ea-4c34-a9c7-8d3f9431889b", "hitokoto": "总会有始料不及的运气和忽如其来的惊喜！", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "小果子吖", "creator_uid": 11964, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649569500", "length": 19}, {"id": 8809, "uuid": "ea614390-274f-47d0-ae81-16cc89f7a6dc", "hitokoto": "如果有人在陪你，你又怎么会看这些文字。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "风间琉璃", "creator_uid": 11970, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649581607", "length": 19}, {"id": 8811, "uuid": "f1547161-3acf-4724-a298-1b09d46bf336", "hitokoto": "落幕时留下的轮廓和灰烬是留给这世界的一个吻和一份叹息。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649918373", "length": 27}, {"id": 8812, "uuid": "c6fa88ff-51c6-478d-b024-353735398e84", "hitokoto": "心碎和遗憾拼凑出来的风华绝代、美不胜收，血染的玻璃最令人无法自拔。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649918257", "length": 33}, {"id": 8813, "uuid": "67fa6d52-39f2-4045-a7e3-18cf7e9f7dc8", "hitokoto": "人在年轻时，不该遇到太惊艳的人。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649918227", "length": 16}, {"id": 8814, "uuid": "650517ce-355c-44aa-bd3b-9b97d5a92505", "hitokoto": "他们不配做知己，不必有结局。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "D5xun", "creator_uid": 12014, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649918207", "length": 14}, {"id": 8820, "uuid": "be659e1a-5484-4982-b492-b9caab9a3043", "hitokoto": "生活是晨起暮落，日子是柴米油盐，喜欢烟火气的平淡与真实。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "•᷄ࡇ•᷅", "creator_uid": 11568, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1648635562", "length": 28}, {"id": 8829, "uuid": "1f453123-950f-4c3f-969a-4677ff378dc2", "hitokoto": "人生纵使失败了99次，也要再努力一次，哪怕仅仅是为了凑个整数。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "AoralsFout", "creator_uid": 11926, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649416611", "length": 31}, {"id": 8835, "uuid": "a8f420a3-0f9e-4cf2-8664-c1bf42ef638e", "hitokoto": "反正年纪还小，日子还长，那就一边生活，一边期待吧。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "智浅", "creator_uid": 11842, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1649061404", "length": 25}, {"id": 8859, "uuid": "ca6652d1-6d03-41ff-994b-e3ae70dec012", "hitokoto": "对于沙漠中的旅行者，最可怕的不是眼前无尽的荒漠，而是心中没有绿洲。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663340245", "length": 33}, {"id": 8862, "uuid": "40347df1-b91b-4c34-b841-c359a2fd0441", "hitokoto": "一种事物，一种感情，一旦失衡，就会失去它原来该有的样子。", "type": "f", "from": "失衡(我的世界地图)", "from_who": "乏味", "creator": "wcz1459", "creator_uid": 13629, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1670581104", "length": 28}, {"id": 8863, "uuid": "71f823d7-4c6c-4ffe-97a0-4844c1b04a3a", "hitokoto": "我不知道将去何方，但我已在路上。", "type": "f", "from": "千与千寻", "from_who": "宫崎骏", "creator": "wcz1459", "creator_uid": 13629, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1670583044", "length": 16}, {"id": 8865, "uuid": "7641cee1-215f-4ba1-bfe0-ccf2e3873aa1", "hitokoto": "如果命运扼住了你的喉咙，那你就挠命运的胳肢窝。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663340117", "length": 23}, {"id": 8866, "uuid": "582423a6-0429-4d5a-b234-60a2fc87c340", "hitokoto": "眼睛可以近视，目光不能短浅。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663340269", "length": 14}, {"id": 8867, "uuid": "afd29f3c-ada8-4939-acee-641494fe945f", "hitokoto": "如果惧怕前面跌宕的山岩，生命就永远只能是死水一潭。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663340285", "length": 25}, {"id": 8871, "uuid": "bfb75f93-1fbf-47b2-8ad1-acd9f10073fc", "hitokoto": "我们这个世界，从不会给一个伤心的落伍者颁发奖牌。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663340303", "length": 24}, {"id": 8872, "uuid": "bd205366-985d-4a4a-89c3-29097debdb8c", "hitokoto": "只有登上山顶，才能看到那边的风光。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663340319", "length": 17}, {"id": 8873, "uuid": "629a0366-08cd-483b-bbb7-9a62e9fea820", "hitokoto": "如果圆规的两只脚都动，永远也画不出一个圆。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663340340", "length": 21}, {"id": 8874, "uuid": "45789ceb-bd87-4429-b26f-e88befdea129", "hitokoto": "如果你瞄准月亮，即便迷失也只是落在星河之间。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663340416", "length": 22}, {"id": 8875, "uuid": "72745f6e-bf57-4427-8ea1-85546eedbd4f", "hitokoto": "要活成两种样子 ，发光和不发光，不发光的时候都在为发光准备。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663341095", "length": 30}, {"id": 8876, "uuid": "4ccde4a5-f583-492f-9507-7bb8350b1be8", "hitokoto": "当你对自己诚实的时候，世界上就没有人能够欺骗得了你。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "桉", "creator_uid": 12620, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1663341185", "length": 26}, {"id": 8884, "uuid": "8549fc69-e4bf-46ff-a3f3-aed338e42f8e", "hitokoto": "你是年少的欢喜，倒过来也亦然。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "鵷枭", "creator_uid": 13111, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1664450588", "length": 15}, {"id": 8889, "uuid": "a253fb50-0580-46a3-87df-91de3b98f075", "hitokoto": "其实很多人都没去过自己家乡的景点，别问好不好玩了。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": "佚名", "creator": "天骐", "creator_uid": 13101, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1664184829", "length": 25}, {"id": 8893, "uuid": "4fd0ce14-939c-4b83-a917-8e930307433f", "hitokoto": "在东北挺好的，但是很快秋天就要来了，再不走就冷了。", "type": "f", "from": "贴吧", "from_who": "流浪贴吧老哥", "creator": "泡芙加奶油", "creator_uid": 11059, "reviewer": 1, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1664943832", "length": 25}, {"id": 8909, "uuid": "f8ed7a10-7b65-4052-b773-f68c5b85e88e", "hitokoto": "世界上最耀眼夺目的就是清晨的第一缕阳光和让人心动的脸庞，你一人独占两样。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "孤城浪子12318", "creator": "akskj", "creator_uid": 13329, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1666868411", "length": 36}, {"id": 8913, "uuid": "b29fa209-95eb-452c-85cb-c8ce596b9d62", "hitokoto": "总有一些东西，要用消失来证明珍贵。", "type": "f", "from": "B站", "from_who": "小翊韩墨", "creator": "新世纪的好少年", "creator_uid": 5386, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1669042654", "length": 17}, {"id": 8917, "uuid": "05223399-b7f0-4f52-aad0-4f71b5a6ffdc", "hitokoto": "如果你看过大海，就不会介意池塘里的是非。", "type": "f", "from": "抖音", "from_who": "笔尖上的躁动", "creator": "璃黯", "creator_uid": 13640, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1669946437", "length": 20}, {"id": 8948, "uuid": "c201063f-753f-43ff-8cbf-c25f24ebf98b", "hitokoto": "落尽红缨君不见，轻绘梨花泪沾衣。", "type": "f", "from": "龙族", "from_who": "江南", "creator": "xiaokanla", "creator_uid": 11432, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1665933036", "length": 16}, {"id": 8972, "uuid": "a9c619c3-6373-4a75-800e-83a71a087909", "hitokoto": "与世界繁杂的一切难以和解，但亦如所有年轻的灵魂一样，有一双清澈的眼睛。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "周不渡", "creator": "Baymax1470", "creator_uid": 11722, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1668743001", "length": 35}, {"id": 8989, "uuid": "4f8cfbc8-5381-4ba3-bf75-2f360bfb65ad", "hitokoto": "压力不会转化成动力。热情才会转化成动力，压力只会转化成病历。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "早见hayami", "creator": "QIQI", "creator_uid": 494, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1669296107", "length": 30}, {"id": 9005, "uuid": "390a44d1-1b22-453d-93a8-a593ae602636", "hitokoto": "绕远的路，总有风景。", "type": "f", "from": "洛谷", "from_who": null, "creator": "明年丶明月", "creator_uid": 13255, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1666155266", "length": 10}, {"id": 9015, "uuid": "1cc9ea59-bcd7-4092-8c17-d77d7a830580", "hitokoto": "就算是阴雨天，晾在阳台上的衣服，也会有干的时候。", "type": "f", "from": "是老胡没错", "from_who": null, "creator": "null97", "creator_uid": 13832, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1671766435", "length": 24}, {"id": 9030, "uuid": "d1c03047-a32d-4371-aa52-c48b3401895e", "hitokoto": "被风吹散的思念，卷起不羁的时间。", "type": "f", "from": "霸气句子", "from_who": "一个无归期的人", "creator": "一个无归期的人", "creator_uid": 13774, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1671197093", "length": 16}, {"id": 9031, "uuid": "56aab037-e46b-4b3a-94ad-82c20d8f0697", "hitokoto": "你的世界，我进不去。我的未来，你也不必参与。", "type": "f", "from": "霸气句子", "from_who": "一个无归期的人", "creator": "一个无归期的人", "creator_uid": 13774, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1671197136", "length": 22}, {"id": 9055, "uuid": "8073082a-f5cd-4df9-84e3-0d737a53417a", "hitokoto": "辉煌时刻不常有，能装多久是多久。", "type": "f", "from": "网络评论", "from_who": null, "creator": "zifsy", "creator_uid": 13220, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1665728758", "length": 16}, {"id": 9056, "uuid": "217c74d1-a87a-404c-bfc0-e8a4b6f8dd1f", "hitokoto": "最美不过你回眸，眸中带笑，笑似烟浓雾霭。", "type": "f", "from": "佚名", "from_who": null, "creator": "xiaokanla", "creator_uid": 11432, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1665932514", "length": 20}, {"id": 9057, "uuid": "945de291-0178-4688-adef-d6fa9b396254", "hitokoto": "只要搭载 GTX690 战术核显卡，一发足以摧毁整个航母战斗群！", "type": "f", "from": "甘肃卫视", "from_who": null, "creator": "寄寄子", "creator_uid": 13250, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1666081756", "length": 32}, {"id": 9072, "uuid": "ee015470-85e8-4017-bef9-1b7c72c1fcf7", "hitokoto": "舌头无骨却是伤人最深。", "type": "f", "from": "快手评论", "from_who": "不知名网友", "creator": "748you", "creator_uid": 13265, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1666245045", "length": 11}, {"id": 9073, "uuid": "cceeff35-5aba-4456-9346-a8809523083b", "hitokoto": "你很朴实＝你可以无偿为我工作而且不抱怨。", "type": "f", "from": "快手评论", "from_who": "不知名网友", "creator": "748you", "creator_uid": 13265, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1666245257", "length": 20}, {"id": 9079, "uuid": "4acd1f36-e6a6-40c4-920d-0fc99df6d8d2", "hitokoto": "在我单枪匹马的背后，是爱我的千军万马。", "type": "f", "from": "黛西", "from_who": null, "creator": "330312", "creator_uid": 13319, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1666684840", "length": 19}, {"id": 9086, "uuid": "78672e1e-2a08-403d-9568-374976bd88b0", "hitokoto": "哪里都去不了，就想念起大海来。", "type": "f", "from": "佚名", "from_who": null, "creator": "杜知", "creator_uid": 13357, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1667837334", "length": 15}, {"id": 9094, "uuid": "87c6d25d-a641-4558-9a6e-f9da315a409c", "hitokoto": "其实我们每个人都是一座孤岛。", "type": "f", "from": "佚名", "from_who": null, "creator": "Quorra's chord.", "creator_uid": 13568, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1669693534", "length": 14}, {"id": 9096, "uuid": "75a24a7d-67e9-4e6b-91a1-d6d45ac5c53d", "hitokoto": "我们这群人，苦没有真正苦过，爱没有用力爱过。 每天受着信息大潮的冲击，三观未定又备受曲折。 贫穷不再是正义，又妄图不让金钱成为唯一的追求。 过早看到了更大的世界，勤奋却又不过三天。 热血透不过屏幕，回忆止于游戏和工作。 像一群没有根的孩子，在别人的经历和精神里吵闹。", "type": "f", "from": "佚名", "from_who": null, "creator": "odyy345", "creator_uid": 13621, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1669876462", "length": 133}, {"id": 9101, "uuid": "7d3f7904-0642-488a-840b-afe1e7f87256", "hitokoto": "热情中的冷静让你镇定谦虚，冷静中的热情使你执着不懈。", "type": "f", "from": "佚名", "from_who": null, "creator": "璃黯", "creator_uid": 13640, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1669945699", "length": 26}, {"id": 9103, "uuid": "769442d3-dbe6-4c7e-8a82-ae5128758502", "hitokoto": "有些日子眨眨眼一下子就过去了，然后永远怀念。", "type": "f", "from": "抖音", "from_who": null, "creator": "璃黯", "creator_uid": 13640, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1669945978", "length": 22}, {"id": 9106, "uuid": "eaef9294-84cc-42b8-bcc2-9370a7091d96", "hitokoto": "要发光，而不是被照亮。", "type": "f", "from": "抖音", "from_who": null, "creator": "璃黯", "creator_uid": 13640, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1669946703", "length": 11}, {"id": 9112, "uuid": "23f8a4cf-20c3-4a6d-b6fe-c23fce97bc2b", "hitokoto": "辉煌一刻谁都有，别拿一刻当永久。", "type": "f", "from": "bilibili", "from_who": "杜海皇", "creator": "白日梦想家", "creator_uid": 13652, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1670130092", "length": 16}, {"id": 9115, "uuid": "c474c741-db7d-4fc5-b81c-495e35d07721", "hitokoto": "你看那通天的巨塔，每时每刻都有人往下跳。我小时候不懂，以为那是雪花。", "type": "f", "from": "Twitter", "from_who": "李老师不是你老师", "creator": "崡儚", "creator_uid": 13697, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1670350434", "length": 34}, {"id": 9116, "uuid": "3a1e5d51-c1e3-4c18-ada5-bd8d0acca8b8", "hitokoto": "懵懂少年，不知天涯多远。", "type": "f", "from": "佚", "from_who": "无", "creator": "os7blue", "creator_uid": 1209, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1670316508", "length": 12}, {"id": 9132, "uuid": "68031d9a-77e2-4c9f-b4a7-915762e51741", "hitokoto": "为了理想的实现，航行的孤独在所难免。", "type": "f", "from": "佚名", "from_who": null, "creator": "怠惰的小烨", "creator_uid": 13854, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1672103334", "length": 18}, {"id": 9133, "uuid": "2684a5ec-95b6-429b-8280-99a02941282a", "hitokoto": "因为那里面的理想世界，可能我们看的时候已经把自己代入进去了，故事结尾的时候我们又不得已回来现实，自然会空虚。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "风の第七章", "creator_uid": 13834, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "app", "created_at": "1671883186", "length": 54}, {"id": 9140, "uuid": "98e467e0-c101-4455-bdcd-d5c3b1890240", "hitokoto": "不是消失的太阳，也没多少的力量，仍会尽力地发光。", "type": "f", "from": "草神disco", "from_who": "愚人戏社", "creator": "旅禾Tristan", "creator_uid": 13363, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1672660502", "length": 24}, {"id": 9161, "uuid": "026bcc06-2831-4b18-99ff-453fb1c5925d", "hitokoto": "双向奔赴，丝线重合，我们仰头探望，便是树状星辰。", "type": "f", "from": "Xor Tree", "from_who": "BlankAo", "creator": "6737151", "creator_uid": 14182, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675955520", "length": 24}, {"id": 9165, "uuid": "a23dea5b-517a-4d52-b603-733c909b0279", "hitokoto": "要成为光，因为有怕黑的人。", "type": "f", "from": "现实", "from_who": null, "creator": "xingyu_xuan", "creator_uid": 13879, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1672324090", "length": 13}, {"id": 9178, "uuid": "1fb66f7e-c392-43bc-8898-6989337d7ad5", "hitokoto": "野兽潜心于新的方向，编撰智慧之章，洞悉世界万千。在追随者与侍者的祈祝中，野兽幻化轻盈。一路嬉戏，走遍人间。", "type": "f", "from": "Mozilla 之书, 6:27", "from_who": null, "creator": "Cool-GK", "creator_uid": 11208, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1673244654", "length": 53}, {"id": 9182, "uuid": "9be18dac-69f8-4485-8311-c064cff818b8", "hitokoto": "外卖堵了，是因为红灯多；感情堵了，是因为「绿」灯多。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "gytxtx", "creator_uid": 14020, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1673846058", "length": 26}, {"id": 9189, "uuid": "0a2bcbba-a453-4b4b-8f73-31a1424a8ab3", "hitokoto": "抱竹辞旧岁，好运滚滚来！", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "和离", "creator_uid": 14075, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1674562897", "length": 12}, {"id": 9191, "uuid": "c98bec31-f4e0-4926-965a-6951038a6f37", "hitokoto": "梦想是远方的太阳，虽远却充满光芒。", "type": "f", "from": "谷爱凌", "from_who": null, "creator": "不告诉你", "creator_uid": 14097, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1674822967", "length": 17}, {"id": 9193, "uuid": "5f66b0b5-12e6-4673-b21e-cdb7537fd830", "hitokoto": "愿你历尽千帆，归来仍是少年.", "type": "f", "from": "盛夏", "from_who": null, "creator": "summer", "creator_uid": 14106, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1674966659", "length": 14}, {"id": 9198, "uuid": "7b8b2c21-c608-46b0-8ed9-a9495023f08d", "hitokoto": "虚幻的想象如图毒药，尝试抓住在黑暗天气下的一丝光明，却看不见方向。", "type": "f", "from": "Bilibili", "from_who": null, "creator": "Miriko", "creator_uid": 14136, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675343936", "length": 33}, {"id": 9205, "uuid": "19bbf60a-d8f0-4eb5-967a-05f4c4fe7ee5", "hitokoto": "分手了就是分手了好聚好散大家都各自安好就好了。", "type": "f", "from": "童锦程", "from_who": null, "creator": "登徒子是个好男人", "creator_uid": 14156, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675579411", "length": 23}, {"id": 9206, "uuid": "07ef5e98-d8ba-40c3-ae33-1a0044b28714", "hitokoto": "这世界上没有坏女人和坏男人只有喜欢你的人和不喜欢你的人。", "type": "f", "from": "童锦程", "from_who": null, "creator": "登徒子是个好男人", "creator_uid": 14156, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675579553", "length": 28}, {"id": 9207, "uuid": "84fd714f-60d6-4d72-ab30-c7288b42dd63", "hitokoto": "但滥情成了主流，深情便成了罪过。", "type": "f", "from": "童锦程", "from_who": null, "creator": "登徒子是个好男人", "creator_uid": 14156, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675580068", "length": 16}, {"id": 9208, "uuid": "bd6d57a8-841b-48bd-abd8-4f8b08f8036a", "hitokoto": "真诚加任何一项都是王炸，唯独单出是死牌。", "type": "f", "from": "童锦程", "from_who": null, "creator": "登徒子是个好男人", "creator_uid": 14156, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675580148", "length": 20}, {"id": 9210, "uuid": "62dc356d-befa-4daa-9496-b1446d74cc68", "hitokoto": "思念悬枝，月影迟迟。", "type": "f", "from": "小红书", "from_who": null, "creator": "阿帕契的少女", "creator_uid": 13207, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675852711", "length": 10}, {"id": 9211, "uuid": "243d9b8b-e6ac-4c4f-85a2-9f3809a089fc", "hitokoto": "若你回头看我一眼，我此生不必再见春天。", "type": "f", "from": "佚名", "from_who": null, "creator": "阿帕契的少女", "creator_uid": 13207, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675852765", "length": 19}, {"id": 9224, "uuid": "645b42c4-9d42-44da-8b5b-c9c44b1bf7f5", "hitokoto": "你是我最真模样，从来不曾遗忘。", "type": "f", "from": "唱给雅音宫羽", "from_who": "纯白", "creator": "rinictianyide", "creator_uid": 14187, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1676040431", "length": 15}, {"id": 9225, "uuid": "6dc3ce16-3d21-400b-9dfe-15c49d67626f", "hitokoto": "就算被世界遗忘，我也会陪在你的身旁。", "type": "f", "from": "唱给雅音宫羽", "from_who": "纯白", "creator": "rinictianyide", "creator_uid": 14187, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1676040522", "length": 18}, {"id": 9228, "uuid": "cbdc2dd6-07c2-4e27-a698-283d712640b4", "hitokoto": "月影积陈春秋，垣壁剥落冬夏。", "type": "f", "from": "小红书", "from_who": null, "creator": "阿帕契的少女", "creator_uid": 13207, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1675852848", "length": 14}, {"id": 9240, "uuid": "d53b85ee-6fd5-435e-8dc1-3210b8a174df", "hitokoto": "我没有负着虚伪的重担的勇气，却将真实的重担卸给了她。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "iosdev", "creator_uid": 13706, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1678788236", "length": 26}, {"id": 9250, "uuid": "d15324c9-5d0b-4095-bdca-34a1768abbaf", "hitokoto": "我未曾见过一个早起、勤奋，谨慎，诚实的人抱怨命运不公；我也未曾见过一个认真负责、努力好学、心胸开阔的年轻人，会一直没有机会的。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": "未知", "creator": "lxhmx", "creator_uid": 14476, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1679888053", "length": 63}]